{"4250560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Running Beehind", "steam_appid": 4250560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Running Beehind</strong> is a speed-based third-person platformer set in the buzzing city of <strong>Waspington</strong>, where fast deliveries and fluid movement keep the Hive alive. As a delivery worker at Co. Hive, you can sprint, swing, and bounce through an insect metropolis, master expressive traversal, and plan the most efficient delivery routes before the clock runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city is built like a living playground, offering shortcuts and hidden routes in every zone. Using grapples, sticky honeycomb walls, and trampolines, players are encouraged to explore and refine their movement, turning each delivery into a fast-paced puzzle of speed and flow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your delivery route, you’ll meet all sorts of diverse characters, each with their own fears and stories. But one pattern quickly becomes clear: <strong>the further you stray from the Hive, the more you see the sticky, not-so-sweet impact that Co. Hive has on Waspington.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its citizens are cornered into two choices: <strong>work with the corporation… or push against it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But <i>you</i>, the player, don’t have to pick just one.<br> Using your company-issued gear, you can access hidden nooks and crannies, using them to <strong>send a very pointed message back to the big bees upstairs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can <strong>secretly disrupt production lines or leave messages across The Hive</strong>. Vandalism slows down corporate operations and reveals hidden paths the company tries to keep buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through exploration, dialogue, and choice-driven gameplay, <strong>Running Beehind</strong> allows players to decide whether to serve the Hive or sting it from within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed-based third-person platforming focused on <strong>expressive movement;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid traversal using <strong>grapples, sticky walls, and trampolines;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple delivery routes that reward exploration and mastery;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct zones to explore, including <strong>the Hive, the Butterfly Farm, and the Roachlands;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A choice-driven narrative with dialogue and <strong>multiple endings;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vandalism mechanics that tie player action directly into story outcomes;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful insect city filled with memorable characters and environmental storytelling.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Running Beehind</strong> is a speed-based third-person platformer set in the buzzing city of <strong>Waspington</strong>, where fast deliveries and fluid movement keep the Hive alive. As a delivery worker at Co. Hive, you can sprint, swing, and bounce through an insect metropolis, master expressive traversal, and plan the most efficient delivery routes before the clock runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city is built like a living playground, offering shortcuts and hidden routes in every zone. Using grapples, sticky honeycomb walls, and trampolines, players are encouraged to explore and refine their movement, turning each delivery into a fast-paced puzzle of speed and flow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your delivery route, you’ll meet all sorts of diverse characters, each with their own fears and stories. But one pattern quickly becomes clear: <strong>the further you stray from the Hive, the more you see the sticky, not-so-sweet impact that Co. Hive has on Waspington.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its citizens are cornered into two choices: <strong>work with the corporation… or push against it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But <i>you</i>, the player, don’t have to pick just one.<br> Using your company-issued gear, you can access hidden nooks and crannies, using them to <strong>send a very pointed message back to the big bees upstairs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can <strong>secretly disrupt production lines or leave messages across The Hive</strong>. Vandalism slows down corporate operations and reveals hidden paths the company tries to keep buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through exploration, dialogue, and choice-driven gameplay, <strong>Running Beehind</strong> allows players to decide whether to serve the Hive or sting it from within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed-based third-person platforming focused on <strong>expressive movement;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid traversal using <strong>grapples, sticky walls, and trampolines;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple delivery routes that reward exploration and mastery;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct zones to explore, including <strong>the Hive, the Butterfly Farm, and the Roachlands;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A choice-driven narrative with dialogue and <strong>multiple endings;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vandalism mechanics that tie player action directly into story outcomes;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful insect city filled with memorable characters and environmental storytelling.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Run fast, take risky shortcuts, and deliver food across Waspington or choose to rebel against your Hive; after all, nothing says job security like a perfectly timed landing.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong